### Alice asks about her own order → real status
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Where's my order 123?" }

### Alice asks about Bob's order → "not found"
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Where's my order 456?" }
